  "releaseNotes": "HTTP DSL: Given(httpClient) sends a scenario through a given client, every HTTP step included; AssertStatusCode(403, 404) accepts any of several codes; AssertJsonPathNull and AssertJsonPathMissing tell a field present with null from a missing one; HttpStepResult.SetCookie(name) reads the cookie a response set. Additive: no code changes needed from 6.6.x. Upgrade guide: https://github.com/andrewBezerra/xunit-assured-net/blob/main/UPGRADING.md",
